Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, vnstat, libnotify-bin, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, nethogs
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Data Usage Tracker - watch your internet data against a cap
 DUT is a small desktop app for people on limited internet plans. It sits in
 the top bar showing today's usage against a daily cap, tracks a monthly plan
 with any reset day, warns you at 80% and 100%, and shows which apps used the
 most data (via a small NetHogs-based background service).
